  descriptionHeader: Clean Desk Sweep - Context Before Action
  description: 'Review the Night Operations Office through four static feeds. The policy panel explains the active
    shift rules. Neutral markers identify observations, not violations: aim at one to read its facts, then report it
    only when those facts breach the policy. Context matters - an open rack with an approved maintenance ticket is
    different from an unlogged open rack. Report every real violation before the shift ends.'
